   "intro": "A crossroads with seven roads. An Eevee sits in the exact middle, turning in a slow circle.\n\n*It looks down each road in turn. Every road gets the same long look.*\n\n*It looks at you. Then it gets up, and follows, ten paces back.*\n\n**A carter, passing:** \"That one's been there since spring. Can't make its mind up. You've given it an eighth road, I suppose.\"",
   "choices": [
    {
     "label": "Walk on.",
     "success": {
      "text": "You walk on. Behind you, quick small steps keep time with yours, always ten paces back.",
      "effects": [
       {
